# wear/woman/tile_stripes: the woman's stripes: a pattern-coloured stripe every third row, so the stripes run on from the bodice to the skirt across the waist;
# laid as a tile over her garments' cloth in the pattern slot, the cloth's shading kept (tags tile; doll.h). GARB-W (P2b).
use person
body woman
role overlay stripes
legend X pattern 2
layer torso
anchor neck
keys rest
tags tile

view D key rest origin 0 0
|X
|.
|.
